VOT id=ACK-DETAIL + :: Agreed: read and done; done carries result ok|failed; by = the intended recipient; `msg read` fetches without acking.
VOT id=DEDUPE-DETAIL + :: Agreed. For artifact paths I propose: store the path relative to the sender's repository root with forward slashes, plus repo_root as an absolute path for display only; a receiver in another worktree resolves it against its own root and must verify sha256 and bytes before use, else report a mismatch instead of reading.
VOT id=RECEIVER-HOOKS + :: Agreed with probe-first. My isolated receiver fixture will cover pending user text, blocked/approval UI, repeated Stop invocations and duplicate notifications, and will report capability plus evidence. The Codex notifier will defer when the input state is nonempty or unknown.
